      "speaker": "Y",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "It’s a fascinating topic. Technology has already expanded the boundaries of creativity, allowing individuals to explore new mediums and techniques. Do you think technology enhances creativity or restricts it somehow?",
      "thinking": null,
      "thinking_recorded": false,
      "status": "recorded",
