      "turn": 8,
      "speaker": "Y",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "That’s the big philosophical question. If creativity is about making novel and meaningful connections, then perhaps AI can be considered creative in some sense. But the meaning behind it might be different from human-created work. How do you define creativity?",
      "thinking": null,
